"""
Balloon Defense - a tower defense game in pygame.

Upgrades: every tower has 3 upgrade paths with 5 tiers each.
  - Only ONE path can go past tier 2 (up to tier 5).
  - Only ONE other path can be upgraded, and only up to tier 2.
  - The third path is locked at 0.
  e.g. 5-2-0 is allowed, 3-2-0 is allowed, 5-3-0 and 2-2-2 are not.

Controls
  Click a tower in the shop, then click the map to place it (Shift = place several)
  Click a placed tower to upgrade / sell / change targeting
  SPACE  start next round      F  toggle fast-forward
  ESC    cancel / deselect     R  restart after game over
"""
